WEBVTT

00:12.530 --> 00:20.580
♪From primal chaos to the starry sky♪

00:20.580 --> 00:28.340
♪In the whole world,
we shall hold the balance♪

00:44.920 --> 00:46.940
♪The cauldron tempers divine blades♪

00:46.940 --> 00:50.810
♪The furnace refines the empty void♪

00:52.820 --> 00:54.930
♪The Way is in mystic fate♪

00:54.930 --> 00:58.720
♪Be brave enough to split
the primal chaos wide open♪

01:36.380 --> 01:37.620
[Pull Strings]

01:37.620 --> 01:39.380
[Adapted from the novel
by Yan Gui Zheng Zhuan]

01:39.580 --> 01:43.340
[Jingwei Island]

01:49.590 --> 01:51.690
Junior Ling'e, I'm here to help!

02:03.590 --> 02:05.050
Senior, did you just call me?

02:07.430 --> 02:08.220
It's nothing.

02:08.910 --> 02:10.060
Go on, go on.

02:15.080 --> 02:15.850
Ling'e,

02:15.910 --> 02:18.450
it's your first time out;
steadiness comes first.

02:18.630 --> 02:19.980
This pouch is for you.

02:20.000 --> 02:22.060
Don't open it
unless absolutely necessary.

02:23.240 --> 02:24.820
What counts as absolutely necessary?

02:31.120 --> 02:31.890
A crab!

02:42.360 --> 02:43.170
My shoe!

02:54.100 --> 02:55.260
[Ghostvein Powder]

02:55.280 --> 02:56.820
Ghostvein Powder.

03:07.520 --> 03:08.890
If you're outmatched in a fight,

03:08.960 --> 03:11.780
[Ghostvein Powder]
use Ghostvein Powder.

03:13.280 --> 03:14.500
A bunch of small fry.

03:14.520 --> 03:15.220
Come on!

03:41.060 --> 03:42.300
[Waste means 1,000 copies
of Scripture of Steadiness]

03:44.080 --> 03:44.980
If you waste it,

03:45.000 --> 03:47.410
copy the Scripture
of Steadiness 1,000 times.

03:50.030 --> 03:53.260
Senior, you're so steady.

03:54.700 --> 03:57.660
[Episode 3]

03:57.960 --> 03:59.060
Something's not right.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.850
It's far too quiet here.

04:03.430 --> 04:05.850
Shouldn't beasts swarm this place?

04:13.680 --> 04:14.450
The Resonance.

04:15.960 --> 04:17.850
When a master uses their power,

04:17.870 --> 04:19.370
mana residue is usually left behind.

04:37.310 --> 04:38.410
Why do I keep feeling

04:39.000 --> 04:40.220
someone's following us?

04:44.600 --> 04:46.220
Or am I imagining it?

04:58.830 --> 05:01.020
Such rich and lingering Resonance.

05:02.430 --> 05:03.370
What spell could be strong enough

05:03.390 --> 05:04.900
to leave such a potent Resonance?

05:19.600 --> 05:22.290
This Resonance holds a message.

05:37.070 --> 05:39.170
Afterimage of time-space retrogression.

06:25.000 --> 06:26.730
No wonder no beasts roam the woods.

06:27.360 --> 06:28.850
A mighty master has acted.

06:38.310 --> 06:39.810
Li Changshou,

06:40.390 --> 06:41.340
do you like

06:42.190 --> 06:43.340
the Great Tribulation?

06:44.240 --> 06:45.490
It's her.

06:55.800 --> 06:56.930
Who is she, really?

06:57.600 --> 06:59.020
Why did she come here?

07:01.160 --> 07:02.660
Judging by where the afterimage went,

07:03.430 --> 07:05.100
is she after Sky-Scraping Vine too?

07:13.830 --> 07:15.050
Fairy Yunxiao,

07:15.310 --> 07:17.140
why come here to seize the treasure?

07:18.430 --> 07:19.140
Demon,

07:19.600 --> 07:20.850
how dare you parrot humans' words?

07:28.480 --> 07:29.660
Fairy Yunxiao?

07:35.480 --> 07:36.580
It's not this thing.

07:45.720 --> 07:46.810
The afterimage has faded.

08:00.600 --> 08:02.250
It does look quite similar.

08:02.270 --> 08:03.900
Yet it's not the Sky-Scraping Vine.

08:05.480 --> 08:07.460
But I remember
what the treasure map said.

08:07.720 --> 08:09.660
The Sky-Scraping Vine should be here.

08:20.510 --> 08:21.810
Three-eyed Emerald Serpent.

08:22.310 --> 08:24.170
It's absorbed
the forest's miasma for years.

08:24.310 --> 08:25.610
It has reached the Primal Immortal stage

08:25.870 --> 08:28.540
and can devour
pre-Tribulation Qi refiners.

08:31.040 --> 08:33.490
Little thing, just you wait.

08:37.030 --> 08:38.530
You don't need to hide it.

08:40.440 --> 08:42.730
Senior Youqin is so pretty.

08:43.360 --> 08:44.850
Anyone with eyes

08:45.320 --> 08:46.700
would naturally like her.

08:48.550 --> 08:49.340
No, no, no.

08:49.840 --> 08:51.340
I've long lost that intention.

08:52.750 --> 08:53.530
Actually,

08:54.790 --> 08:55.730
you're also very beautiful.

08:59.270 --> 09:00.060
Really?

09:03.320 --> 09:04.530
You've always been

09:06.630 --> 09:07.420
beautiful.

09:08.670 --> 09:09.980
Wang Qi! Wang Qi!

09:27.750 --> 09:28.580
Something's wrong.

09:36.840 --> 09:37.850
What formation is this?

09:38.320 --> 09:39.610
It's suppressing my powers.

09:40.910 --> 09:42.340
These are just small fry.

09:42.440 --> 09:43.820
That one's the real threat.

09:43.840 --> 09:46.130
The General's order:
Clear them out first,

09:46.240 --> 09:47.130
so they don't get in the way.

09:52.320 --> 09:54.940
This forest is off-limits today.

09:56.200 --> 09:57.530
What nonsense are you spouting?

09:57.840 --> 09:59.980
I'll decide if it's off-limits or not.

10:00.320 --> 10:03.060
So many men, what a grand show.

10:03.240 --> 10:04.250
I'm so scared.

10:04.720 --> 10:06.100
My advice to you is:

10:06.720 --> 10:07.650
Come at me all at once.

10:07.720 --> 10:10.580
We've heard of the Immortal of Wine
of the Ascendance Sect.

10:10.840 --> 10:12.530
Naturally, we came in full force.

10:14.720 --> 10:16.580
A free snack for my wine.

10:21.270 --> 10:22.850
How could I refuse?

10:24.360 --> 10:25.010
Go get her!

10:43.550 --> 10:44.130
Xuanya,

10:45.030 --> 10:45.730
are you alright?

10:46.600 --> 10:47.370
I'm fine.

10:50.390 --> 10:51.180
Come with me.

10:52.840 --> 10:53.610
Alright.

11:01.510 --> 11:03.980
If I'd found
the Fire-Repelling Herb sooner,

11:04.870 --> 11:07.340
your Lotus Firesunder
would be perfected.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.940
Then you wouldn't be suffering

11:10.440 --> 11:11.770
from constant backlash.

11:18.750 --> 11:20.340
The last time I looked at you like this

11:21.960 --> 11:23.340
was when we were children.

11:25.960 --> 11:26.730
That day,

11:27.670 --> 11:30.940
your paper kite broke free, flying off.

11:32.000 --> 11:33.490
You cried so loudly.

11:34.870 --> 11:36.250
I held your hand,

11:36.870 --> 11:38.130
searching for it.

11:39.270 --> 11:40.250
We kept searching.

11:41.750 --> 11:44.420
All these years, I'd try my best to get

11:44.440 --> 11:46.490
whatever you want.

11:47.270 --> 11:48.060
Xuanya,

11:48.120 --> 11:50.180
though our sect values tranquility,

11:50.270 --> 11:52.060
it doesn't forbid the marital bond.

11:52.840 --> 11:53.730
All these years,

11:54.480 --> 11:55.730
don't you understand

11:56.030 --> 11:57.370
my feelings for you?

12:06.000 --> 12:06.770
Yuan Qing,

12:08.360 --> 12:09.650
why do you seek the Way?

12:10.080 --> 12:10.610
I...

12:11.270 --> 12:12.250
My aspiration for the Way

12:13.080 --> 12:14.610
began to sprout that day.

12:16.080 --> 12:17.820
A paper kite can soar into the sky.

12:19.000 --> 12:20.180
Aren't people the same?

12:22.510 --> 12:25.130
If you only pursue
what everyone pursues,

12:25.720 --> 12:28.010
you'll never see a wider sky.

12:31.600 --> 12:33.010
You always want
to retrieve the paper kite.

12:35.000 --> 12:36.820
But to the kite that flew away,

12:37.870 --> 12:39.420
that is release and freedom.

12:42.270 --> 12:43.220
So...

12:45.200 --> 12:45.850
Sorry.

12:47.910 --> 12:48.700
Junior.

12:51.360 --> 12:52.130
Thank you

12:53.200 --> 12:56.220
for giving me the push I needed.

14:39.750 --> 14:40.530
It's you.

14:42.670 --> 14:45.580
My experience didn't help this time.

14:47.200 --> 14:48.890
The real thorn in my side

14:49.670 --> 14:50.980
was actually you.

14:52.120 --> 14:53.010
You're courting death.

14:56.390 --> 14:57.650
Then, I have no choice.

16:37.440 --> 16:38.300
General.

16:38.390 --> 16:40.980
The Binoct Trihead Spider's silk
is unbreakable.

16:41.000 --> 16:42.340
Don't waste your strength.

16:45.390 --> 16:46.370
You set this up long ago

16:46.390 --> 16:47.460
to lure me here.

16:48.840 --> 16:49.610
General,

16:49.720 --> 16:52.100
are you this naive in the war?

16:53.270 --> 16:55.490
A greenhorn like you dares talk of war?

17:23.790 --> 17:25.700
You little brat.

17:28.310 --> 17:30.250
What trap have you laid for me?

17:30.590 --> 17:31.940
Freeze Spell and Poison Formation!

17:31.960 --> 17:33.140
Freeze?

17:33.640 --> 17:34.220
Behead!

17:37.270 --> 17:39.490
A mere Freeze Spell.

17:51.000 --> 17:52.900
Besides the Freeze Spell, what else?

17:53.310 --> 17:54.900
What?

17:55.030 --> 17:57.220
Besides the Freeze Spell, what else?

17:58.110 --> 17:58.860
Poison Formation.

18:02.200 --> 18:04.090
You foresaw that too.

18:08.000 --> 18:08.770
General.

18:10.680 --> 18:11.940
The white cloth
covers your face already?

18:13.400 --> 18:14.010
General.

18:14.790 --> 18:15.810
You can't sleep here!

18:15.830 --> 18:16.290
General.

18:25.160 --> 18:27.090
My time is up. Don't try to save me.

18:28.440 --> 18:29.220
General,

18:29.830 --> 18:31.380
I dare to ask you one thing.

18:32.400 --> 18:33.530
Is the one who sent you

18:34.400 --> 18:35.180
to do this...?

18:46.160 --> 18:47.730
I have failed them.

18:48.880 --> 18:50.810
Just let me die.

18:52.510 --> 18:53.700
No, no, no.

18:53.960 --> 18:55.050
You're tickling my tickle spot.

18:55.070 --> 18:56.010
What are you doing?

18:56.400 --> 18:57.090
I'm licking your bag.

18:57.110 --> 18:58.090
No, no, no.

18:58.830 --> 18:59.770
What do you mean?

18:59.790 --> 19:00.420
It means...

19:01.000 --> 19:01.810
You wouldn't understand.

19:01.830 --> 19:03.330
No, no, stop, stop.

19:03.350 --> 19:05.620
I just want to die.

19:05.640 --> 19:06.700
General, don't worry.

19:06.750 --> 19:08.420
Soon, I'll grind your bones to dust

19:08.440 --> 19:09.220
and destroy your body.

19:09.240 --> 19:10.290
I don't want to die like that.

19:10.310 --> 19:10.860
Don't worry.

19:10.880 --> 19:11.570
I offer a full service.

19:11.590 --> 19:11.980
Very professional.

19:12.000 --> 19:12.700
Painless, or...?

19:12.720 --> 19:13.490
Give it to me.

19:19.720 --> 19:20.940
Leaving in such a hurry?

19:29.110 --> 19:30.250
Hell is other people.

19:30.590 --> 19:31.810
So this is the Primordial Wilds.

19:35.680 --> 19:36.380
Rest in peace.

19:36.960 --> 19:37.570
General.

19:48.880 --> 19:52.050
Ashes fly in a moment;
a pit takes a century.

19:53.880 --> 19:54.860
Thank you for your guidance.

19:59.070 --> 19:59.940
A Side Quest complete.

20:04.550 --> 20:06.050
Only 95% certain.

20:06.070 --> 20:07.290
That's too risky.

20:09.790 --> 20:11.010
Would this be better?

20:15.680 --> 20:16.810
Senior Changshou.

20:18.790 --> 20:19.730
Senior Changshou.

20:21.790 --> 20:22.570
Senior,

20:23.310 --> 20:23.980
run!

20:24.750 --> 20:25.810
You can't win.

20:31.880 --> 20:34.250
Good heavens, you lost the Message Jade

20:34.270 --> 20:35.900
and nearly had a love gu cast on you.

20:36.400 --> 20:38.010
Even your sword is cracked.

20:38.880 --> 20:40.620
If you hadn't given away
all the elixirs,

20:40.880 --> 20:42.490
you wouldn't be so down and out.

20:46.790 --> 20:47.530
In that case,

20:47.550 --> 20:49.090
am I not also to blame?

20:50.720 --> 20:53.330
Why such heavy karma again?

21:00.110 --> 21:00.620
Never mind.

21:09.550 --> 21:10.330
Evade!

21:51.830 --> 21:52.730
Saved!

21:56.200 --> 21:57.290
Senior Changshou.

21:58.960 --> 21:59.490
Changshou...

22:07.960 --> 22:09.090
He...

22:13.750 --> 22:14.330
No!

22:22.880 --> 22:24.940
I was too impatient.

22:24.960 --> 22:26.050
I wanted a shortcut.

22:26.070 --> 22:26.810
So,

22:26.920 --> 22:27.810
I tried all kinds of pills.

22:27.960 --> 22:29.050
Not only did it not improve,

22:29.070 --> 22:29.490
but also...

22:29.830 --> 22:30.940
I contracted a condition:

22:31.110 --> 22:32.010
Touching a woman

22:32.030 --> 22:33.660
makes me convulse.

22:53.030 --> 22:56.180
Senior Changshou is gravely ill.

22:57.070 --> 22:58.900
Yet he still came to my aid.

22:59.960 --> 23:01.530
Such noble character.

23:02.680 --> 23:05.900
How could I judge him so meanly?

23:10.960 --> 23:12.700
Fellow disciples need no thanks.

23:12.720 --> 23:14.810
I left some elixirs
and mystic incantations.

23:14.960 --> 23:17.220
People are more treacherous
in the mountains.

23:17.270 --> 23:19.330
Withdraw at once. Your life is at stake.

23:19.680 --> 23:22.220
Left by a nameless handsome fellow.

23:22.640 --> 23:24.140
Senior Changshou's handwriting

23:24.640 --> 23:26.220
is truly one of a kind.

23:26.680 --> 23:28.010
Just like the man himself.

23:28.140 --> 23:29.100
[I left some elixirs
and mystic incantations.]

23:29.100 --> 23:30.020
[People are more treacherous
in the mountains.]

23:30.020 --> 23:30.820
[Left by a nameless handsome fellow.]

23:35.380 --> 23:37.180
[Head southwest]

23:37.200 --> 23:38.330
Head southwest.

23:40.310 --> 23:42.940
Senior arranged it all so well.

23:51.400 --> 23:53.770
Detoxify. Disperse qi.

23:57.790 --> 24:00.290
Apply to the back of the head.

24:02.000 --> 24:03.860
Did I hurt the back of my head?

24:29.160 --> 24:31.090
A snake's bane is never far away.

24:31.480 --> 24:32.770
When the Purplegold Grass is burned,

24:32.920 --> 24:34.490
it'll emit a pungent odor

24:34.750 --> 24:36.290
and drive the giant python mad.

24:36.640 --> 24:37.570
Next,

24:38.070 --> 24:39.980
I need to place it just right.

24:44.750 --> 24:45.730
Junior Changshou.

24:47.480 --> 24:48.140
Well.

24:48.200 --> 24:50.380
I'm old; my ears ring terribly.

24:50.400 --> 24:51.290
What's going on?

24:51.510 --> 24:52.530
Junior Changshou.

24:53.240 --> 24:55.860
Junior Changshou, please save me!

24:57.440 --> 24:58.420
Junior Changshou.

24:59.070 --> 25:00.250
Senior Yuan Qing.

25:00.440 --> 25:01.570
Junior Changshou.

25:02.000 --> 25:02.810
Senior Yuan Qing.

25:02.830 --> 25:03.420
Junior.

25:03.440 --> 25:04.460
Senior, what happened to you?

25:04.640 --> 25:05.700
Junior Changshou,

25:06.200 --> 25:09.140
Xuanya and I were ambushed on the road.

25:09.880 --> 25:11.420
The attacker was very strange.

25:11.590 --> 25:14.620
We heard him but saw no one.

25:15.960 --> 25:17.770
We both fell into his trap.

25:18.110 --> 25:20.140
Xuanya drew him away
at the risk of her life.

25:20.960 --> 25:22.380
So, I could barely escape.

25:23.310 --> 25:24.900
It must be Yuwen Ling.

25:25.680 --> 25:27.490
He has mastered the Invisibility Art.

25:27.720 --> 25:30.700
He hides in the woods with ill intent.

25:30.920 --> 25:32.290
The Invisibility Art?

25:33.350 --> 25:35.330
If Yuwen Ling knows this art,

25:35.480 --> 25:36.570
why did he reveal himself

25:36.590 --> 25:38.090
to us in the first place?

25:40.590 --> 25:41.090
I...

25:42.400 --> 25:44.860
I don't know what he's thinking.

25:45.400 --> 25:46.810
You have a point.

25:47.640 --> 25:49.290
I wonder how Xuanya is faring.

25:50.590 --> 25:51.900
If she is safe and sound,

25:52.830 --> 25:54.050
my heart can rest easy.

25:54.310 --> 25:56.220
If any harm has come to her,

25:56.920 --> 25:59.010
my death won't atone for this.

26:01.510 --> 26:02.700
Senior, don't worry.

26:03.350 --> 26:04.660
After I return to the mountain,

26:04.830 --> 26:07.090
I'll post more search notices for you

26:07.440 --> 26:09.810
to honor your tragic, beautiful love.

26:10.480 --> 26:11.250
Junior.

26:11.270 --> 26:12.010
Senior.

26:12.240 --> 26:12.900
Junior.

26:12.920 --> 26:13.700
Senior.

26:14.240 --> 26:15.090
Junior, watch out!

26:15.110 --> 26:16.380
Senior, hide behind me.

26:32.720 --> 26:33.660
[Hall of Mortal Coils]
What hexagram?

26:33.790 --> 26:35.290
This hexagram is extremely ominous.

26:35.750 --> 26:37.330
In Kuru Land,

26:37.590 --> 26:40.050
Changshou might be in grave danger.

26:40.400 --> 26:41.730
Pah, pah, pah!

26:41.750 --> 26:42.810
Is your divination even accurate?

26:42.830 --> 26:43.940
Don't spout nonsense.

26:45.750 --> 26:47.860
My divination accuracy

26:48.160 --> 26:49.380
has always been consistent.

26:49.550 --> 26:50.980
I can get it right

26:51.200 --> 26:52.220
about half the time.

26:52.240 --> 26:53.250
Half the time.

26:53.920 --> 26:55.180
Then, you're just guessing blindly?

26:55.200 --> 26:56.770
Isn't fortune-telling
just blind guessing?

26:56.790 --> 26:58.460
You guess yours; I'll divine mine.

27:04.000 --> 27:06.050
Changshou said he'd be fine,

27:06.070 --> 27:06.860
so he must be...

27:06.880 --> 27:07.980
Something's wrong!

27:08.480 --> 27:09.250
What happened?

27:09.510 --> 27:10.380
Uncles,

27:10.510 --> 27:12.180
we just got word from Aunt Jiu Jiu:

27:12.200 --> 27:13.380
At Miasma Grove,

27:13.680 --> 27:14.700
something's wrong.

27:17.100 --> 27:19.380
[Great Ominous]

27:20.640 --> 27:21.770
May I ask:

27:22.400 --> 27:23.380
Where did I

27:23.790 --> 27:25.250
give myself away?

27:27.400 --> 27:28.860
Was it my spiritual aura?

27:29.920 --> 27:31.490
I studied Concealment Art
for three years.

27:31.790 --> 27:33.900
Even if my mentor were here,

27:34.030 --> 27:35.940
he wouldn't sense my presence.

27:39.160 --> 27:40.660
Could it be the smell?

27:41.350 --> 27:42.180
Impossible.

27:42.750 --> 27:43.620
When I came here,

27:43.750 --> 27:45.860
I didn't leave a single footprint.

27:46.680 --> 27:47.530
I know.

27:50.510 --> 27:51.530
It's my eyes.

27:52.000 --> 27:52.900
I admit

27:53.590 --> 27:54.570
that my gaze

27:55.480 --> 27:57.730
often holds a sharp glint.

27:58.160 --> 27:59.180
Alright, alright.

27:59.200 --> 28:00.140
Stop overthinking it.

28:00.790 --> 28:01.860
Truth be told,

28:02.110 --> 28:03.380
Yuwen Ling has confessed

28:03.400 --> 28:04.420
that he's your accomplice.

28:04.720 --> 28:05.490
What?

28:08.160 --> 28:08.940
Indeed.

28:09.550 --> 28:11.770
Yuwen Ling is indeed my accomplice.

28:12.440 --> 28:14.460
I concede defeat.

28:15.240 --> 28:17.220
Yuwen Ling is late for the rendezvous.

28:17.960 --> 28:18.730
I suppose

28:20.480 --> 28:21.980
you've already dealt with him.

28:22.000 --> 28:23.140
That's impossible.

28:23.790 --> 28:24.980
Aunt Jiu Jiu said so.

28:25.400 --> 28:26.570
Junior Changshou,

28:26.830 --> 28:28.380
it's fine if you deny it.

28:28.590 --> 28:30.140
Aren't you curious

28:30.920 --> 28:33.980
how I persuaded that royal lackey?

28:34.110 --> 28:35.420
Why should I be curious?

28:38.880 --> 28:41.090
When he provoked Aunt Jiu Jiu
in Anshui City,

28:41.680 --> 28:42.530
I already noticed

28:42.550 --> 28:44.090
he was your lackey.

28:44.110 --> 28:45.810
You're so patient in your plotting.

28:45.830 --> 28:48.460
If Uncle Kuai Si could learn half of it,

28:49.000 --> 28:50.980
his power grab wouldn't be so hard.

28:52.790 --> 28:54.010
Junior Changshou,

28:55.200 --> 28:57.010
you're quite like me.

28:57.550 --> 28:58.620
You flatter me.

28:59.160 --> 29:01.460
I don't have the resolve to be a hero

29:01.640 --> 29:03.620
or the interest in playing the villain.

29:04.550 --> 29:06.180
To be honest, Senior Yuan Qing,

29:06.200 --> 29:09.570
we could have stayed clear
of each other.

29:14.400 --> 29:15.980
I schemed and plotted every move

29:16.720 --> 29:18.980
yet overlooked you.

29:19.110 --> 29:21.770
How can I rest easy knowing that?

29:22.440 --> 29:24.530
I've wasted words with you for so long

29:24.640 --> 29:25.420
just to wait

29:28.000 --> 29:30.940
for Soullock Smoke to work.

29:42.160 --> 29:43.140
Softspirit Powder.

29:44.000 --> 29:45.220
Likewise.

29:45.240 --> 29:46.010
You...

29:47.240 --> 29:48.010
Tell me.

29:48.830 --> 29:50.770
You've laid out this grand scheme.

29:51.400 --> 29:53.010
What for?

29:54.070 --> 29:54.860
I...

29:55.440 --> 29:56.420
As for this question,

29:57.000 --> 29:58.050
I'll answer it for him.

30:03.750 --> 30:04.810
Xuanya.

30:04.830 --> 30:05.620
Changshou.

30:06.550 --> 30:07.460
Xuanya.

30:08.350 --> 30:09.050
Changshou.

30:14.270 --> 30:14.730
Jiu Jiu.

30:15.070 --> 30:15.530
Jiu Jiu.

30:17.920 --> 30:18.700
Jiu Jiu.

30:18.790 --> 30:19.090
Changshou.

30:19.880 --> 30:20.140
Wake up!

30:20.160 --> 30:20.660
Junior.

30:20.750 --> 30:21.490
Jiu Jiu.

30:21.790 --> 30:22.940
- Junior Jiu is the best
- Jiu Jiu.

30:23.480 --> 30:25.050
at swordsmanship in this generation.

30:25.480 --> 30:27.490
Unexpectedly, she also met with tragedy.

30:28.000 --> 30:30.180
Junior Jiu, wake up!

30:30.240 --> 30:31.010
Jiu...

30:33.350 --> 30:33.810
Shh.

30:43.830 --> 30:45.010
Wine.

30:45.920 --> 30:46.940
Wine.

30:49.400 --> 30:51.290
- Stop craving wine.
- Wine.

30:51.480 --> 30:52.250
Junior Jiu.

30:52.680 --> 30:53.460
Come on.

30:53.790 --> 30:54.570
Ms. Jiu Jiu.

30:55.680 --> 30:57.700
Tell me where Changshou is first.

30:57.720 --> 30:58.700
Shh.

30:59.440 --> 31:01.490
Let me have one drink first.

31:02.310 --> 31:03.660
Stop drinking.

31:04.110 --> 31:05.900
Tell me

31:06.160 --> 31:07.770
where Changshou is!

31:08.510 --> 31:11.140
Yuan Qing has posed for decades

31:12.350 --> 31:14.220
for Youqin Xuanya.

31:14.880 --> 31:15.490
No.

31:16.750 --> 31:17.900
To be exact,

31:18.310 --> 31:19.050
you were only

31:19.070 --> 31:21.330
after the Donglin royals behind her.

31:22.240 --> 31:25.140
When coaxing failed, he used threats.

31:25.270 --> 31:27.250
He wanted to make me a puppet
with gu worms.

31:27.830 --> 31:29.420
Once I fell under his control,

31:30.350 --> 31:32.250
the Senior Grandee could use that

31:32.270 --> 31:33.490
to seize the realm.

31:34.160 --> 31:34.900
Yuan Qing,

31:35.400 --> 31:36.700
is it true or not?

31:37.160 --> 31:38.460
So what if it is?

31:39.310 --> 31:40.530
Man can shape fate.

31:40.830 --> 31:42.220
Wait.

31:42.510 --> 31:43.860
Let me ask one thing.

31:44.790 --> 31:47.010
Why are you here?

31:48.750 --> 31:49.810
Senior Changshou,

31:50.310 --> 31:52.180
didn't you lead me southwest?

31:53.180 --> 31:55.380
[Head southwest, Entrance]

31:56.550 --> 31:58.660
But this is northeast.

31:59.440 --> 32:00.940
Forget Youqin.

32:00.960 --> 32:02.290
Call yourself Fool.

32:02.310 --> 32:03.290
Absolutely not.

32:04.000 --> 32:05.810
If she loses that title,

32:06.110 --> 32:08.420
she'll be of no use.

32:08.960 --> 32:13.010
Senior Yuan Qing, wake up.

32:13.880 --> 32:18.700
Your century of cultivation is ruined.

32:18.830 --> 32:20.810
Rather than the future,

32:21.400 --> 32:23.330
I should focus on the present.

32:23.960 --> 32:28.730
I must fulfill my clan's grand wish.

32:28.960 --> 32:29.730
Hold your tongue.

32:31.160 --> 32:32.730
Now that I've survived,

32:32.750 --> 32:35.090
I'll shatter your ambitions myself.

32:35.960 --> 32:37.330
Let me just adjust my stance.

32:42.350 --> 32:43.810
Majesty seals the law,

32:44.310 --> 32:45.770
purifying the world.

32:46.750 --> 32:47.220
Wait.

32:47.400 --> 32:47.900
Break!

33:10.590 --> 33:11.530
Why?

33:13.480 --> 33:16.770
The Firescale Sword?
A national treasure?

33:16.960 --> 33:17.460
I'd say

33:18.750 --> 33:20.140
it's nothing special.

33:20.400 --> 33:21.810
You have no idea

33:21.830 --> 33:24.050
what that sword truly means

33:24.640 --> 33:26.420
or why you're drawing it.

33:29.960 --> 33:30.940
Come to think of it,

33:31.550 --> 33:33.090
you've always been just

33:33.110 --> 33:35.860
a self-absorbed little princess.

33:40.960 --> 33:43.810
He tampered with your sword long ago.

33:44.350 --> 33:45.980
Once you use your power,

33:46.070 --> 33:48.380
your Qi will explode,

33:48.440 --> 33:51.330
and he'll use the chance
to repair his foundation

33:51.350 --> 33:52.730
and dispel the toxins.

33:57.960 --> 34:00.980
Junior Changshou is indeed clever.

34:01.920 --> 34:02.940
What a pity.

34:03.720 --> 34:07.730
A dead man's wit no longer matters.

34:08.550 --> 34:11.300
I've already made up a story for you.

34:11.320 --> 34:13.860
A male disciple assaulted
a female disciple,

34:13.880 --> 34:16.130
and they both perished.

34:34.480 --> 34:35.610
What a poor fool.

34:37.550 --> 34:38.690
No, Junior Youqin.

34:39.360 --> 34:40.650
Her wounds haven't healed yet.

34:40.760 --> 34:42.090
And rage consumes her.

34:42.280 --> 34:43.900
It seems she won't wake up for now.

34:47.440 --> 34:48.740
Why can you still move?

34:51.110 --> 34:53.340
I can't help it.
I've been poisoned before.

34:53.360 --> 34:54.300
Senior Yuan Qing,

34:54.320 --> 34:56.210
so, over the years,

34:56.230 --> 34:58.740
I've developed a very bad habit.

34:59.280 --> 35:01.490
I like to hide a Wishwell Pill

35:01.510 --> 35:02.610
inside my decayed tooth.

35:02.710 --> 35:03.490
Let me tell you.

35:03.510 --> 35:05.170
The Wishwell Pill
wards off wind and toxins.

35:05.230 --> 35:06.380
It's a cure-all.

35:07.150 --> 35:07.940
I think I still have some left.

35:07.960 --> 35:08.690
I'll share some with you.

35:08.710 --> 35:09.650
That won't be necessary.

35:10.630 --> 35:12.690
So, you've been watching

35:12.710 --> 35:13.900
from the sidelines.

35:15.590 --> 35:16.650
I'm done talking to you.

35:16.670 --> 35:17.490
You're a bad man.

35:17.510 --> 35:19.010
I'll go back to the sect and report you.

35:19.670 --> 35:20.570
Li Changshou,

35:21.230 --> 35:22.820
I will never let you off.

35:23.510 --> 35:24.300
Xuanya!

35:24.440 --> 35:25.210
Changshou!

35:25.960 --> 35:26.380
Strange.

35:26.400 --> 35:26.940
Xuanya!

35:27.230 --> 35:28.820
The last message I received

35:28.840 --> 35:30.300
is near here.

35:30.320 --> 35:31.420
That was

35:31.440 --> 35:32.460
four hours ago.

35:36.190 --> 35:37.340
There, there.

35:39.840 --> 35:40.530
Xuanya!

35:40.550 --> 35:41.260
Changshou!

35:41.440 --> 35:42.130
Strange.

35:42.150 --> 35:42.570
Are you okay?

35:42.590 --> 35:44.170
Both disciples are exhausted.

35:44.360 --> 35:46.170
Then who took down these assassins?

35:46.360 --> 35:48.050
Enough talk.
Help them up and wake them up.

35:48.070 --> 35:48.740
Right, right.

35:49.670 --> 35:50.460
Changshou!

35:52.280 --> 35:53.050
Changshou!

35:54.760 --> 35:55.530
Changshou...

36:05.760 --> 36:07.900
Jiu Jiu, luckily, they're still alive.

36:11.840 --> 36:12.490
- Junior.
- Xuanya.

36:13.150 --> 36:14.530
Are you alright?

36:15.550 --> 36:16.340
I'm fine.

36:17.510 --> 36:18.980
So, Qi Yuan's foundation

36:19.000 --> 36:20.380
was ruined here

36:20.400 --> 36:20.860
in the Miasma Grove.

36:20.880 --> 36:21.650
Yes, yes, you...

36:24.710 --> 36:25.980
I misspoke.

36:28.190 --> 36:29.530
It's okay.

36:30.510 --> 36:33.010
Times change; the past is like the wind

36:34.280 --> 36:35.490
and pale clouds.

36:36.920 --> 36:39.610
I've long been detached.

36:40.670 --> 36:41.650
Don't cause trouble here.

36:41.920 --> 36:42.940
Go wait outside, alright?

36:44.190 --> 36:45.260
I swear to you

36:45.400 --> 36:46.980
that I'll bring Changshou back.

36:47.000 --> 36:47.690
No.

36:48.550 --> 36:50.300
He's my disciple; I'm his mentor.

36:50.320 --> 36:51.530
Whether he's alive or dead,

36:51.550 --> 36:52.820
I will personally bring him back.

36:56.880 --> 36:57.740
Junior,

36:58.630 --> 37:00.170
though you are muddled,

37:00.320 --> 37:01.420
your disciple

37:01.440 --> 37:02.900
is a clever little devil.

37:02.920 --> 37:03.300
Yes.

37:03.320 --> 37:04.090
Rest assured.

37:04.150 --> 37:06.940
He'll turn misfortune into blessing.

37:10.920 --> 37:11.740
Senior,

37:13.760 --> 37:14.940
I'll hold you to that.

37:15.000 --> 37:15.820
That's the spirit.

37:16.840 --> 37:17.300
This...

37:57.480 --> 37:58.570
Blacktortoise Shield.

38:09.480 --> 38:10.940
Colorless Evasion.

38:29.630 --> 38:31.050
Ascension Stage.

38:33.440 --> 38:34.740
Reversion Stage.

38:42.550 --> 38:44.460
Thunders Art of the Reunion Stage.

38:45.280 --> 38:47.130
How much cultivation are you hiding?

38:49.480 --> 38:50.740
Well.

38:56.000 --> 38:56.780
Where did he go?

38:57.320 --> 38:58.170
I'll tell you alone.

38:58.190 --> 38:59.300
I rely on sudden enlightenment.

39:01.760 --> 39:02.530
Where did he go?

39:03.590 --> 39:05.690
Believe me.
I rely on sudden enlightenment.

39:06.000 --> 39:08.420
Enlightenment, my foot!

39:11.880 --> 39:12.780
Well, well.

39:13.150 --> 39:15.780
Senior Yuan Qing scolds sweetly.

39:15.880 --> 39:16.740
Honestly...

39:22.480 --> 39:23.900
You are not the only one

39:24.550 --> 39:26.420
who can play the fool.

39:26.840 --> 39:30.260
This Gnatsting Needle was made
by a Blood Sea demon.

39:30.360 --> 39:33.570
Dying from it is an honor.

39:35.440 --> 39:36.460
So, three years ago,

39:37.030 --> 39:38.530
at Mistveil Division,

39:39.440 --> 39:41.690
Yuan Man died in cultivation.

39:42.280 --> 39:43.940
You're behind it too.

39:44.000 --> 39:45.980
Since you know the truth,

39:47.280 --> 39:49.460
I cannot spare you now.

39:55.280 --> 39:57.650
A last struggle.

40:37.440 --> 40:39.340
With a petty trick like this,

40:40.670 --> 40:42.530
you think you can stop me?

40:44.210 --> 40:46.490
♪In the Primordial World♪

40:46.490 --> 40:48.230
♪Who sings and drinks free♪

40:49.440 --> 40:51.940
Then I'll show you a grand trick.

40:52.150 --> 40:54.130
Stay here. Don't wander off,

40:55.320 --> 40:56.570
though it matters not if you do.

40:56.920 --> 40:57.900
It's already late.

40:59.310 --> 41:01.200
♪Predict the clock of time♪

41:01.440 --> 41:03.980
♪Learn the watches of the night♪

41:03.980 --> 41:05.990
♪The hearth smoke rises high♪

41:05.990 --> 41:08.080
♪Let the comings and goings be♪

41:08.080 --> 41:10.230
♪Let the answer be empty♪

41:10.230 --> 41:11.630
♪A varied life♪

41:12.760 --> 41:14.380
I lost fair and square.

41:15.590 --> 41:16.420
Junior.

41:17.070 --> 41:19.050
My mentor has a secret.

41:19.280 --> 41:21.340
- I can't take it to the grave.
- What?

41:21.360 --> 41:22.820
Do you want to know?

41:22.880 --> 41:23.380
What?

41:23.960 --> 41:24.940
I can't hear you.

41:25.030 --> 41:26.420
Come closer.

41:27.670 --> 41:29.860
Come here; let me tell you.

41:30.760 --> 41:31.900
I don't care.

41:33.230 --> 41:34.010
You...

42:27.190 --> 42:27.940
Sky-Scraping Vine.

42:45.280 --> 42:46.010
Sky-Scraping Vine.

42:50.440 --> 42:51.650
My precious Sky-Scraping Vine.

42:51.880 --> 42:53.380
Mission complete.

43:00.670 --> 43:01.460
What's this?

43:02.280 --> 43:03.090
The Gnatsting Needle?

43:08.590 --> 43:09.900
Senior Yuan Qing

43:10.150 --> 43:12.300
is swift to kill, utterly shameless.

43:12.550 --> 43:14.130
He's really hero material.

43:14.840 --> 43:15.860
What a pity.

43:19.360 --> 43:20.650
Stop, villain!

43:23.190 --> 43:23.980
Senior.

43:24.480 --> 43:25.380
Junior Xuanya.

43:25.400 --> 43:26.380
Senior, are you alright?

43:26.400 --> 43:27.130
I'm fine.

43:27.360 --> 43:28.460
Thanks to your sword strike,

43:28.480 --> 43:29.610
that villain was badly wounded too.

43:29.630 --> 43:31.010
He barely dragged me here.

43:31.150 --> 43:32.740
Then we met a Three-Eyed Python.

43:32.760 --> 43:34.130
It swallowed him in one gulp.

43:34.190 --> 43:35.010
Swallowed?

43:37.800 --> 43:38.570
Look.

43:39.150 --> 43:40.610
Only this much left.

43:43.480 --> 43:44.340
He deserves it.

43:45.110 --> 43:47.460
Senior, where's the python?

43:53.110 --> 43:53.900
The python!

43:57.510 --> 43:58.300
Run!

44:18.190 --> 44:18.570
Come.

44:18.590 --> 44:19.940
- One, two, three.
- Don't choke me!

44:20.400 --> 44:20.780
Alright.

44:22.110 --> 44:22.610
Hold on tight.

44:25.150 --> 44:25.740
Changshou.

44:25.760 --> 44:26.210
Xuanya.

44:26.760 --> 44:28.490
How did Yuan Qing humiliate you?

44:30.110 --> 44:31.130
Say something!

44:31.150 --> 44:32.860
Stop asking! Heal her wounds now!

44:33.150 --> 44:33.690
Right, right.

44:33.710 --> 44:35.650
Changshou, how are you?

44:35.670 --> 44:36.340
Where are you hurt?

44:36.360 --> 44:37.130
I'm fine.

44:37.150 --> 44:37.940
You're fine?

44:38.230 --> 44:39.010
Where's the wound?

44:40.150 --> 44:41.300
My injuries are internal.

44:41.440 --> 44:42.260
Internal injuries?

44:42.880 --> 44:43.650
Where are they?

44:44.670 --> 44:45.460
Mentor,

44:46.400 --> 44:48.130
did you see any Resonance along the way?

44:48.840 --> 44:50.170
With your meager cultivation,

44:50.190 --> 44:51.780
you even claim to have Resonance?

44:51.800 --> 44:52.940
You're all talk.

44:53.230 --> 44:54.010
What are you doing?

44:54.360 --> 44:55.210
There was Resonance today.

44:55.230 --> 44:56.340
My disciple is gifted.

44:56.360 --> 44:57.130
You're jealous.

44:59.710 --> 45:00.820
Senior, sorry, sorry.

45:00.960 --> 45:02.050
Hair, hair, hair.

45:03.510 --> 45:04.170
That person

45:04.760 --> 45:06.050
is called Fairy Yunxiao.

45:06.920 --> 45:08.420
What brings her here?

45:09.150 --> 45:10.490
With such strength,

45:10.630 --> 45:13.010
retrieving her Resonance isn't hard.

45:13.360 --> 45:15.010
Why didn't she do that?

45:18.400 --> 45:19.170
That's not right.

45:19.550 --> 45:21.380
She lured me with Resonance on purpose.

45:21.760 --> 45:22.980
She's also searching
for the Sky-Scraping Vine.

45:34.360 --> 45:35.130
She...

45:36.000 --> 45:38.380
has been watching everything
from behind me.

46:05.840 --> 46:08.860
So, the Sky-Scraping Vine
was hidden inside the rock.

46:09.960 --> 46:11.690
That kid is cunning and sly.

46:12.070 --> 46:13.460
He might prove useful in the future.

46:13.460 --> 46:14.630
[Fairy Yunxiao,
Quasi-Saint of Seizing Sect]

46:14.630 --> 46:15.740
Little brat.

46:16.480 --> 46:17.980
We shall meet again.

46:54.070 --> 46:59.850
♪See mortal joys and sorrows♪

47:00.520 --> 47:07.220
♪Reunions and partings, as fate unfolds♪

47:08.750 --> 47:14.800
♪Alas, love has many twists and turns♪

47:15.430 --> 47:21.880
♪Memories filled with sorrow♪

47:22.620 --> 47:29.740
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

47:30.120 --> 47:37.020
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

47:37.400 --> 47:44.750
♪Tearfully,
this life's bond is not over♪

47:44.750 --> 47:51.920
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪

48:08.060 --> 48:13.230
♪Down a few more cups of wine♪

48:14.320 --> 48:21.340
♪Through land and sea,
I ask you to come♪

48:22.530 --> 48:28.470
♪For honor's sake, upright and grand♪

48:29.170 --> 48:36.250
♪Alas, our story is short♪

48:36.590 --> 48:43.700
♪Slowly, wishes turn to regret♪

48:44.020 --> 48:50.500
♪You've gone afar, like mist fading♪

48:51.280 --> 48:58.490
♪Tears fall, this fate's not done♪

48:58.880 --> 49:06.700
♪Past fragments vanish into night♪
